// The session state the reducer takes and gives back: numbers (gym_cell_* in conf.id) and texts (gym_text_*). Some of it is the window's own (the screen, the typed answer, the picked confidence); the rest is read back from the log by the engine layer after every operation. Nothing else is state: the clock reaches it as a tick event.
struct Session {
  int[] cells;
  string[] texts;
}
